{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京公演が終わってから\nオフの日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校行ってそのままリハだったから\n明るいうちに帰るのが久しぶりなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/14/3745199/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は暑かったですね。\nもう夏だねー半袖でいけるね\n日焼け止めちゃんと塗らなきゃねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば乃木どこ見ましたか？\n私ったらかなにナイスアシスト"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/14/3745199/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/14/3745199/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スター講座、なかなか難しかった。\nほとんど間違えてたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこれだけは自信を持って言える..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はアントニオ猪木さんと\n誕生日がおなじ！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/14/3745199/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/14/3745199/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}